#: scenario:scenario_7E64D941_CE36_4FDD_BE44_6DA9F1407E3B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a7f2f2853880b7bf09d087d7d27e70fd49d87e0984e30eac0160070ed011c177
