#: scenario:scenario_370DCC67_C39B_47A0_8F61_70DDD955AB8F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1399bc74a59df480aff2f22f35aa5f89ae4cf3b841607bb00ce51a03129ff66f
