msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1F7CC047_6D13_4B15_AD9A_EEE76759DCA0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Would that your father were still alive,⟪k:1⟫perhaps I could have done something."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Если бы твой Отец был все еще жив,⟪k:1⟫возможно, я смог бы помочь."

#: scenario:scenario_4BE88004_71D6_4B98_A66A_E5992C29AB9A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
