#: scenario:scenario_CBB6E073_DDF1_4378_A794_363AD8A605F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8f7bbe4055aabfe88fc76354b29621800ff78f7e173d2d18aae5c366e98e5d5
